fix             light all adapt 1 pair soft a 1*3 3 v_prefactor pair soft a 3 4*4 v_prefactor reset no
velocity        all create 300.0 4928459 dist gaussian
fix             lang all langevin 300.0 300.0 100.0 48279
fix             cap all nve/limit 0.05
timestep        1.0
thermo          1000
run             5000
